# Byte-stability for hashes that commit to exact file bytes:
# - corpora/lean kernel hashes cover the exact .lean bytes
# - tests/test_schemas.py freezes the checked-in schema files byte-identically
# (their blobs are LF; eol=lf keeps every checkout - Windows included - in
# agreement with the frozen digests).
*.json text eol=lf
*.lean text eol=lf
